    "note": "One scenario per alert in alerts.yaml: input series in promtool notation at a one-minute interval, and three evaluation instants \u2014 before the condition (healthy), after it has held past the rule's `for` (firing) and after recovery (cleared). `php tools/verify-alert-rules.php --write` renders deploy/observability/tests/alerts.test.yaml from this file and the rules, deriving every expected label and annotation from the rule itself; CI runs `promtool test rules` over the result.",
